# Festerleech: "Whenever this creature deals combat damage to a player, you mill two cards." Damage dealt to a blocking creature is not damage to a player, so the trigger is
# not met (CR 510.2, 603.2). Bot1's Leech attacks on turn 3 and Bot2's Memnite blocks it; both die, nothing is milled and Bot2 stays at 20. The unblocked attack in
# festerleech-pumps-once-each-turn-and-combat-damage-to-a-player-mills-two is the positive control.

[Bot1 Deck]
Festerleech
Mox Jet
Island x5
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Mountain x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Festerleech.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Festerleech > Bot2)
Bot2.Block(Memnite > Festerleech)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 20
Bot1.Graveyard = Festerleech
Bot2.Graveyard = Memnite
